# Campus 360 Data / Newsroom

Supabase + Prisma are the backend foundation (see `docs/adr/0001-supabase-prisma.md`).

- Schema and migrations live in `packages/db`.
- Internal auth is Supabase Auth; profiles live in `user_profiles`.
- Object storage goes through `@campus360/storage` (Supabase Storage).
- Newsroom is `apps/newsroom` — implement Guide newsroom workflows there, not Payload Admin.
- Never expose private source notes, internal comments, or commercial internals in public APIs.
- Prefer typed repositories/services over ad hoc Prisma calls in UI components.
